Package: ponpokodiff
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: two-file visual diff viewer for V\OS
 PonpokoDiff graphically compares two text files side by side: changed
 lines are yellow, removed lines red, added lines green. Double-click
 opens the left or right file with its preferred application, and
 renamed or moved files are offered for reload.
